  "scope": {
    "en": "This manuscript represents the outcome of a formal Delphi process resulting in an official Position Statement of the ESGE and provides a framework to develop and maintain skills in POEM. This curriculum is set out in terms of the environment for training, the theoretical knowledge and practical skills required for completion of training, and how competence should be defined and evidenced prior to independent practice."
  },
